(C) Compton from the exact square W = E'_0^2 + 3 p . p: a row of momentum k absorbed by a body at rest, a row of momentum k' released at the angle theta;
  W before = (E'_0 + sqrt 3 k)^2 with the row's energy sqrt 3 k in E' units on the pair c^2 = [1, 3]; after: (E'_0 + sqrt 3 k - sqrt 3 k')^2 = E'_0^2 + 3 |k - k'|^2
  => 1 / k' - 1 / k = sqrt 3 (1 - cos theta) / E'_0, i.e. lambda' - lambda = (h / (Q S M c)) (1 - cos theta) with lambda = h / k, c = 1 / sqrt 3, exactly.
  the declared world: Q S M = 64 (S = 1, M = 1), the lamp's quantum h = 1 at the turn s = 16 steps per self-creation, so k = h s = 16 label units;
  the fan of the re-emitter: the six headings (cos theta = 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, -1) and the twelve face diagonals (cos theta = +-1/sqrt 2 or 0)
  theta = 0 (+x): k' = 16.000 label units, the released turn s' = floor(k' / h) = 16 steps (from 16), the body's recoil |p| = 0.00 label units (0.000 of Q S M)
  theta = 45 deg (face diagonal forward): k' = 14.199 label units, the released turn s' = floor(k' / h) = 14 steps (from 16), the body's recoil |p| = 11.68 label units (0.182 of Q S M)
  theta = 90 deg (+-y, +-z): k' = 11.165 label units, the released turn s' = floor(k' / h) = 11 steps (from 16), the body's recoil |p| = 19.51 label units (0.305 of Q S M)
  theta = 135 deg (face diagonal back): k' = 9.200 label units, the released turn s' = floor(k' / h) = 9 steps (from 16), the body's recoil |p| = 23.43 label units (0.366 of Q S M)
  theta = 180 deg (-x): k' = 8.574 label units, the released turn s' = floor(k' / h) = 8 steps (from 16), the body's recoil |p| = 24.57 label units (0.384 of Q S M)
  at the heading's own c = 32 / 55 the row's energy is (96 / 55) k (17.6 M7) and gamma^2 - 3 = 141/3025 = 0.0466:
  the relation then holds to first order in (k - k') / k with the residual (gamma^2 - 3) (k - k')^2 / (2 E'_0 gamma) in k', second order (the error term at the heading's c).
  at 90 deg with the heading's c: k' = 11.195 (against 11.165 on the pair), the floor of k' / h the same or one less
  at 180 deg with the heading's c: k' = 8.611 (against 8.574 on the pair), the floor of k' / h the same or one less

